## Testing
**Unit**: Pure utilities without network I/O. Mock at adapter boundary.
**Integration**: Critical handlers and streaming paths with fixtures.
**CI**: Parallelizable tests. No shared global state. Fast feedback loops.

## Security
**Secrets**: Never commit. Read from env/runtime managers. Redact in logs.
**Input Safety**: Validate and sanitize. Enforce size limits. Escape suspicious content.
**Transport**: HTTPS only. Verify certs. Short-lived in-memory caches preferred.

## Deployment
**Docker**: Minimal images (node:lts-slim). `NODE_ENV=production`. Run as non-root.
**Cloudflare Workers**: No Node-only APIs. Guard conditional imports. Workers-compatible bundling.
**Kubernetes**: Minimal ports. Configure resources/probes. Externalize secrets. Explicit autoscaling.

